@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD06 — F10 saved actuals before qualitative analysis
boundary "PostEventPanel / EventPlanningCLI" as V
control EventPlanningController as C
control EventPlanningFacade as F
participant AdaptivePlanningService as S
entity Event as E
participant BudgetService as B
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
V -> C : recordPostEvent(eventId, data) [user confirms actuals]
C -> F : recordPostEvent(eventId, data)
F -> S : record(event, data)
note over S : Validate outcome task IDs against approved tasks
S -> E : storePostEventData(data)
ref over F : SD07 save actuals separately
V -> C : analyzePostEvent(eventId)
C -> F : analyzePostEvent(eventId)
F -> S : analyze(event)
S -> E : getPostEventData()
alt Actuals record absent
  S --> F : IllegalArgumentException; record outcomes first
else Actuals record exists (nullable fields allowed)
  opt Approved budget matches current currency and has no unknown item costs
    S -> B : totalExpenses(event.getBudget())
    B --> S : approved planned expense total
  end
  note over S
    Java calculates actual-minus-planned attendance/expense,
    approved-task completion rate and missing-information flags.
    Baseline is current approved plan, not frozen event close.
  end note
  S -> A : milestoneOutput(qualitative instruction, recorded outcomes/context)
  ref over A : SD08 model generation; no invented outcome data
  A --> S : summary / successes / issues / lessons / recommendations
  note over S : Construct PostEventReport with computed values and outcome snapshot
  S -> E : storeReport(report)
  ref over F : SD07 save report before success
  F --> C : PostEventReport
  C --> V : report / explicit missing information
end
note over V,E : No historical currency identity; no claim that fictional demo outcomes actually occurred
@enduml
